  "rationale": "Brunello knockout library in HEK293T-hACE2 cells, screen 2 (SARS-CoV-2 MOI 0.3, day 10; Grodzki et al. 2022). Column names follow the GSM titles (BrT0puro = Day 0, D10-Cont = uninfected cells continued to day 10, BrCov-ST = SARS-CoV-2 single infection). The authors compared infected replicates with 'uninfected control library replicates' in MAGeCK without naming them; median-normalized log fold changes of their top genes (ACE2, CTSL, CCZ1B, TMEM251) match the day-10 uninfected controls better than Day 0, and the day-10 controls are time-matched, so they are the reference. Replicates are separate cultures, so no replicate term. The BrBact columns are not described in GEO and are not used.",
